WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.503
The bull and the Seven Sisters.

00:03.203 --> 00:12.072
Follow Orion's belt up and to the right and you reach the orange eye of the bull, Aldebaran, and past it a small knot of blue stars.

00:12.522 --> 00:17.311
They are the Pleiades, a real family of stars that were born together.

00:17.761 --> 00:24.645
Japan calls them Subaru, and for Māori their return before dawn, as Matariki, begins the new year.
